WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.730
Pluto and Charon, going round each other.

00:03.430 --> 00:10.484
New Horizons crossed this pair on 14 July 2015, nine and a half years out from Earth.

00:10.934 --> 00:18.606
It found mountains of water ice, and beside them a plain of nitrogen ice that is still slowly turning over.

00:19.056 --> 00:23.249
Sending the pictures home took until October 2016.
